  "definition": "Off-site Stump Dumps",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-21",
  "historyNote": "#7225, eff 3-31-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2510.09); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
